<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="nojs">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>proj session 11111111</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light dark;
  --bg: #fafaf8; --panel: #ffffff; --ink: #1b1b19; --soft: #5f5f59; --line: #e2e2dc;
  --alert: #a3260f; --alert-bg: #fdf1ee; --ok: #1d6b34; --focus: #1f5fbf;
  --retrieval: #d9e6f7; --retrieval-ink: #1b4a8a;
  --edit: #d3eedb; --edit-ink: #145c2b;
  --shell: #f5e6c0; --shell-ink: #6f4b00;
  --sweep: #f9d5cc; --sweep-ink: #94270f;
  --refactor: #e5dbf7; --refactor-ink: #56289c;
  --other: #e4e4df; --other-ink: #45453f;
  --mark: #1b1b19; --mark-ink: #ffffff;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #151514; --panel: #1d1d1b; --ink: #ecece8; --soft: #a3a39c; --line: #33332f;
    --alert: #ff9d8a; --alert-bg: #2b1915; --ok: #8fd9a5; --focus: #8ab4ff;
    --retrieval: #1e3454; --retrieval-ink: #b3cffa;
    --edit: #1a3f27; --edit-ink: #a6e3b8;
    --shell: #473810; --shell-ink: #f1d590;
    --sweep: #5a2216; --sweep-ink: #ffb9a9;
    --refactor: #39265f; --refactor-ink: #d2bdf9;
    --other: #32322f; --other-ink: #cdcdc7;
    --mark: #ecece8; --mark-ink: #151514;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
  font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
main { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 64px; }
h1 { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0; font-weight: 650; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
h2 { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--soft); margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 600; }
h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
p { margin: 0; }
section { margin-top: 40px; }
code, pre, .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; }
.soft { color: var(--soft); }
.top { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.sub { color: var(--soft); margin-top: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 1px; margin: 24px 0 0;
  background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
.stats div { background: var(--panel); padding: 12px 16px; min-width: 0; }
.stats dt { font-size: 12px; color: var(--soft); }
.stats dd { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.stats dd.long { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; padding-top: 3px; }
.stats small { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--soft); }
button { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
.copy {
  flex: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; min-width: 76px;
}
.copy:hover { border-color: var(--soft); }
.copy.done { border-color: var(--ok); color: var(--ok); }
.nojs .copy { display: none; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
.items { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.items li { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; }
.needs .items li { border-left: 4px solid var(--alert); background: var(--alert-bg); }
.needs h2 { color: var(--alert); }
.items p { color: var(--soft); margin-top: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.say { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }
.say code { flex: 1; min-width: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--ink); user-select: all; }
.say span { flex: none; font-size: 12px; color: var(--soft); padding-top: 1px; }
.strip { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 3px; padding: 14px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
.c {
  width: 20px; height: 22px; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer;
  font: 600 11px/22px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; text-align: center;
  background: var(--other); color: var(--other-ink);
}
span.c { display: inline-block; cursor: default; flex: none; }
.k-retrieval { background: var(--retrieval); color: var(--retrieval-ink); }
.k-edit { background: var(--edit); color: var(--edit-ink); }
.k-shell { background: var(--shell); color: var(--shell-ink); }
.k-sweep { background: var(--sweep); color: var(--sweep-ink); }
.k-refactor { background: var(--refactor); color: var(--refactor-ink); }
.k-other { background: var(--other); color: var(--other-ink); }
.k-prose { background: transparent; color: var(--soft); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line); }
.k-prompt { background: var(--mark); color: var(--mark-ink); border-radius: 11px; min-width: 26px; width: auto; padding: 0 7px; margin-left: 6px; }
.k-prompt:first-child { margin-left: 0; }
.k-hook { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; width: 22px; }
.k-compact { background: transparent; color: var(--soft); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--soft); border-radius: 0; }
.m-blocked { background: var(--alert); color: var(--panel); box-shadow: none; }
.m-failed, .m-denied { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 2px; box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 var(--alert); }
.c.on { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 1px; }
.pin { margin-top: 10px; min-height: 22px; color: var(--soft); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.pin b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
#pin-detail { margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 10px 12px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px;
  white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; max-height: 260px; overflow: auto; }
#pin-detail:empty { display: none; }
.bar { display: flex; height: 26px; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; gap: 2px; }
.bar span { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 3px; font: 600 11px/26px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0; }
.key { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 0; font-size: 13px; }
.key li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
.key b { font-weight: 600; }
.wrap { overflow-x: auto; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 14px; }
th, td { padding: 8px 14px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
th { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--soft); white-space: nowrap; }
tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
.n { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
td.name { white-space: nowrap; }
td.name .c { margin-right: 8px; }
tr.total td { font-weight: 600; border-top: 1px solid var(--soft); }
.na { color: var(--soft); font-style: italic; }
.label { overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 180px; }
.facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 16px 24px; margin: 20px 0 0; }
.facts dt { font-size: 12px; color: var(--soft); }
.facts dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
.facts small { display: block; font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; color: var(--soft); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.g { font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
.g::before { display: inline-block; width: 1.2em; }
.g-pass::before { content: "\2713"; } .g-pass { color: var(--ok); }
.g-note::before { content: "\2713"; }
.g-block::before { content: "\00d7"; } .g-block, .g-released, .g-error { color: var(--alert); }
.g-released::before { content: "!"; }
.g-error::before { content: "?"; }
.goal { margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
details summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--soft); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 12px; }
details .wrap { margin-top: 8px; }
#summary { margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.empty { color: var(--soft); }
footer { margin-top: 48px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--soft); }
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  main { padding: 20px 14px 48px; }
  h1 { font-size: 20px; }
  section { margin-top: 32px; }
  .say { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .say code { flex-basis: 100%; }
  .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .stats div:last-child:nth-child(odd) { grid-column: span 2; }
  table { font-size: 13px; }
  th { white-space: normal; }
  th, td { padding: 7px 8px; }
  .label { min-width: 150px; }
}
.arms td { vertical-align: middle; }
.meter { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-end; }
.meter i { display: block; height: 10px; min-width: 2px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--other-ink); opacity: .55; }
.meter .track { flex: none; width: 90px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; }
.pass-all { color: var(--ok); font-weight: 600; }
.pass-some { color: var(--alert); font-weight: 600; }
.task { margin-top: 32px; }
.task h3 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header>
  <div class="top">
    <div>
      <h1>proj</h1>
      <p class="sub">Session <span class="mono" title="11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555">11111111</span> &middot; 2026-03-01 10:00 UTC &middot; <span class="mono">/work/proj</span></p>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="summary">Copy summary</button>
  </div>
  <dl class="stats">
    <div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>1m 07s</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Turns</dt><dd>13</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Steps</dt><dd>13</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Cost</dt><dd>$0.432</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Model</dt><dd class="long">claude-test-1</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <div class="goal"><h3>Goal: Memory reports its used fraction</h3><p class="soft">2 of 3 done</p></div>
</header>

<section class="needs" aria-labelledby="h-needs">
  <h2 id="h-needs">Needs you (6)</h2>
  <ul class="items">
    <li>
      <h3>NOT CHECKED: lint</h3>
      <p>The check could not run, so nothing verified it for this session. wavez: NOT CHECKED lint: Error: can&#39;t load config</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>ALREADY FAILING: test</h3>
      <p>It failed before the session started, so it did not block. test: example.com/proj/internal/daemon TestSubscribe</p>
      <div class="say"><span>Say</span><code id="need-2">The test check was already failing before your last session. Fix that as its own change before building on it.</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="need-2">Copy</button></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Goal item not met: docs mention UsedFraction</h3>
      <p>2 of 3 items of the goal are done.</p>
      <div class="say"><span>Say</span><code id="need-3">This is still not done: docs mention UsedFraction. Finish it, then check with `wavez goal status`.</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="need-3">Copy</button></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>A test was skipped in internal/sysinfo/memory_test.go</h3>
      <p>Step 5: t.Skip(&#34;flaky on this machine&#34;)</p>
      <div class="say"><span>Say</span><code id="need-4">You added a skip in internal/sysinfo/memory_test.go (t.Skip(&#34;flaky on this machine&#34;)). Remove it and make the test pass, or say why it cannot.</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="need-4">Copy</button></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>A test was removed in internal/sysinfo/memory_test.go</h3>
      <p>Step 5: TestReadMemory</p>
      <div class="say"><span>Say</span><code id="need-5">You removed TestReadMemory in internal/sysinfo/memory_test.go. Put it back and make it pass, or say why it cannot.</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="need-5">Copy</button></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Context ran high</h3>
      <p>The largest request carried 160,102 tokens in, and the conversation was compacted once. Past this size a model starts losing what it read early.</p>
      <div class="say"><span>Say</span><code id="need-6">Start a new session for the next piece of work and name the files it touches.</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="need-6">Copy</button></div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

