<section aria-labelledby="h-waste">
  <h2 id="h-waste">Waste, and what to say next time</h2>
  <ul class="items">
    <li>
      <h3>1 file read more than once</h3>
      <p>Read more than once: internal/sysinfo/memory.go 2 times.</p>
      <div class="say"><span>Say</span><code id="waste-1">The work is in internal/sysinfo/memory.go. Read a file once, in full, and start there.</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="waste-1">Copy</button></div>
    </li>
    <li>
